      remedy: Open More details: it names each program, why it matters and what to do.
      note:   Microsoft Entra Global Secure Access client: Microsoft documents that this client
              doesn't tunnel virtual machines' traffic and isn't supported on devices that host
              VMs. Workspaces have no network of their own: their traffic leaves through Puddle's
              proxy, an ordinary program on this computer, which the client handles like any other
              app. If company resources reached through Global Secure Access don't work from a
              workspace, this limitation is the likely cause. Puddle can't change it: ask your IT
              team for another way to reach them.

